{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Mandate candidates in elections to attend the returning officer's announcement",
        "additional_details": "People who wish to represent a constituency in Parliament should account for themselves and be present at the Returning Officer's announcement of the result of an election. We believe it's a basic courtesy to voters and fellow candidates. ",
        "background": "Candidates for elections to Parliament should attend the Returning Officer's declaration of the result or forfeit their right to represent the seat.",
